                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="6b2a8df2-cb0b-5493-974f-d27207ce83fd">Target unit may only Move, Advance, Charge, and Fall Back at half speed until your next Psychic Phase. The same unit cannot be affected by more than one instance of Undermine at a time.</characteristic>
